<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Resources raises NSTP stake.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Resources raises NSTP stake.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian Resources Corp Bhd (MRCB) said on Tuesday it had increased its stake in publishing group, the New Straits Times Press (Malaysia) Bhd (NSTP), to 45.40 percent.</p>
<p>MRCB had said on April 26 that its shareholding in NSTP stood at 45.26 percent.</p>
<p>MRCB said it had acquired the additional 76,000 shares on the open market at prices ranging from 13.30 ringgit to 13.80 ringgit per share.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
